  "description": "An author named Ha Yunseo with her pseudonym Red Cherry. She has a passion for writing and immediately decided to work at a book publishing company called Miracle Story. Not without reason though, the decision was made because Yunseo is interested in the CEO named Baek Seunghyeok. Seunghyeok's appearance shows a cold figure but, apparently, the personality of a handsome guy is different when he reads the work of Red Cherry. Seunghyeok doesn't know that Yunseo, his new employee, is Red Cherry, the writer who is very idolized. \n\nThis romantic genre comic tells the life of a romantic story writer who has never felt a love affair. It's about a CEO who turns out to keep a secret that only one person knows! Duh, what is the secret?",
